  = \frac{1}{\varepsilon} P Q P^{-1} \cdot P U,
\end{displaymath}
and the symmetrizer $A_0$ can be substituted by $P A_0 P^{-1}$.
Therefore, henceforth, when assuming the quasi-stability of 
the matrix $Q$, we consider the form of $Q$ to be 
\begin{displaymath}
